# Graphify scope for the Building Operations Platform monorepo.
#
# Graphify already honours .gitignore, which covers node_modules/, dist/, build/,
# .next/, out/, coverage/ and *.tsbuildinfo. This file only adds what .gitignore
# deliberately does NOT exclude, so the graph stays focused on architecture.
#
# Deliberately NOT excluded (these belong in the graph):
#   apps/api/prisma/schema.prisma            — the BM-01/BM-02 domain model
#   apps/api/prisma/migrations/manual/*.sql  — temporal EXCLUDE + partial unique
#                                              constraints that Prisma cannot express
#   packages/contracts, packages/i18n        — cross-workspace shared surface

# --- Lockfiles: enormous, zero architectural signal -------------------------
package-lock.json
yarn.lock
pnpm-lock.yaml

# --- Editor / tooling state, not project source ----------------------------
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
.v3code/
.context-bridge/

# --- Graphify's own output (never let a run ingest its previous run) --------
graphify-out/

# --- Binary assets: fonts are committed on purpose (offline Persian UI),
#     but they are opaque blobs with nothing for tree-sitter to parse. --------
apps/web/src/assets/fonts/
*.woff
*.woff2
*.ttf
*.otf
*.eot

# --- Generated Prisma client, if a future config emits it outside node_modules
apps/api/generated/
**/.prisma/
